#. Description of the plugin
#: banners-og.php
msgid "Builds 1200x630 Open Graph banners in the WordPress admin and publishes them as og:image. No external service, no GD or Imagick."
msgstr "Gera banners Open Graph de 1200x630 dentro do admin do WordPress e publica a imagem como og:image. Sem serviço externo, sem GD nem Imagick."

